SY_TALK("dkdEn77IIwE",[[0,["EnTc Peter VC 2019-0428"]],[2,["Yesterday I was talking about two things, which"]],[7,["we have to do in England, which one should understand, you see."]],[12,["Because every country has its own problems"]],[15,["and we do absorb the problems."]],[20,["[Shri Mataji speaks aside in Hindi sounds like “Left hamari aur kar. Left hand, ha.]"]],[24,["[In Hindi: Point your left hand towards Me,"]],[29,["point your right hand outwards]."]],[43,["Now the thing is our work is spreading very fast"]],[50,["and people are taking to it."]],[57,["In Europe I find the land is much more fertile, surprisingly"]],[64,["and once people get realization they become fantastic,"]],[68,["I mean they think it’s something that they have been expecting"]],[71,["and they understand Sahaj Yoga much better than we understand here."]],[76,["Though your Kundalinis rise very high, I’ve seen that,"]],[80,["but the progress is not that all right."]],[88,["Now Ray has been to India, he’ll tell you how,"]],[90,["what sort of people we have in India"]],[93,["and how they have progressed themselves."]],[97,["Now as I said the main problem of our country is lethargy"]],[102,["and lethargy is something we have to overcome somehow"]],[107,["and this lethargy is a, actually a satanic force."]],[113,["It’s not lethargy only of the matter that comes from"]],[117,["material domination on the Spirit, but it is really satanic"]],[123,["because it stops your progress and is to be avoided."]],[130,["And to get out of it one has to be really alert about it,"]],[136,["how it crawls onto you."]],[139,["Krishna has put, the worst vice in the whole world is “aalasya”,"]],[144,["means lethargy. “Aalasyso Bijayate”"]],[147,["– everything comes out of aalasya."]],[149,["According to Him, first the lethargy comes in"]],[153,["and because of lethargy we get into vices"]],[156,["and then we go to the right side also because of lethargy."]],[161,["Because just to avoid the lethargy we go to the right side too much."]],[165,["So according to Him everything starts with lethargy"]],[170,["and then the person loses the essence of life through lethargy"]],[177,["and this is our special quality and that is our real problem"]],[182,["– is the lethargy."]],[185,["Because Sahaj Yoga is a thing where we say there is “akriya”."]],[189,["We don’t have to do anything. It is effortless."]],[193,["Everything works out effortless, spontaneously."]],[197,["So we think that everything is going to work out for us spontaneously."]],[202,["Only the Kundalini Jagruti is spontaneous for the first time,"]],[208,["not for the second time, only for the first time."]],[212,["That is I have to do it or My photograph has to do it."]],[217,["But afterwards you have to work,"]],[220,["you have to keep your Kundalini afloat."]],[223,["You have to understand what are your problems,"]],[226,["what are you getting into."]],[228,["I mean, individually every one of you is a masterpiece,"]],[233,["individually. Because of lethargy you are clouded."]],[238,["Secondly because of lethargy you are secluded,"]],[243,["lethargy gives you also ego."]],[246,["Because anything that challenges lethargy"]],[249,["you get on top of that person, you don’t like such a person."]],[253,["But the lethargy also those do not have"]],[256,["are the people their attention is not on spiritual development."]],[260,["Theirs is as I told you yesterday, on other things,"]],[263,["which are not important to spiritual life."]],[266,["We pay so much attention to other things than to our spiritual life."]],[271,["Why is it? Why is it we pay more attention to material things,"]],[275,["to material comforts, to material achievements,"]],[279,["to material obsessions? Why? You must think about it."]],[285,["And why not to our spiritual ascent?"]],[287,["The reason is we have been identified with matter."]],[293,["We have been going through that circle."]],[297,["We thought that we must have material development,"]],[301,["so we had industrial revolution, we created a society"]],[306,["dominated by industries, machinery came up."]],[310,["We saw the machinery started dominating us."]],[313,["We wanted to misidentify from that machinery."]],[318,["Machinery has also given us lethargy"]],[321,["because we use machine made things our hands do not work."]],[325,["We have lost all the deftness of the hands;"]],[329,["we have lost all the walking capacity."]],[332,["We can only take a bus or a car; we do not want to walk at all."]],[338,["Now this mechanization and the use of matter too much,"]],[342,["has made us sort of matters ourself. We have become matter"]],[350,["that we cannot live without it, it, yet we are so identified with it."]],[355,["After realization if you are still identified with the matter,"]],[359,["then your realization slows down. So to, one has to understand,"]],[365,["one has to understand fully that matter is absolutely secondary."]],[375,["Without of course getting your body you cannot receive realization,"]],[379,["you have to have your body."]],[381,["But matter which is gross, is of no meaning."]],[384,["Subtle matter is all right for us, that’s important."]],[388,["Like this light, which is burning, is important."]],[392,["Water that is in the ocean is all right."]],[396,["The sky, open sky – say here it is not so good"]],[400,["but if you go to a country is even better."]],[403,["The Mother Earth say example here, I don’t know how it is,"]],[406,["but in India certain places Mother Earth is very much subtle,"]],[412,["your material identifications."]],[415,["So matter has been identified with us, we have been using it,"]],[419,["living with it and that’s why it is easy for us to get back"]],[422,["into the same circle of matter."]],[426,["And we get into it, we pay attention more to it."]],[429,["Now if I say, “Do not pay attention to it more,” then"]],[432,["you go on to another side, in a subtler way you jump into vices."]],[437,["Vices of – I can say uncleanliness, filth, dirt, mismanagement."]],[449,["So from one extreme to another extreme you go."]],[453,["Now in the center what is matter, we should understand, and"]],[455,["we should try to then identify ourselves with our Spirit."]],[462,["Now what is matter? Let us find out."]],[465,["What is matter this. And what is created out of matter?"]],[471,["Matter you know is made out of five elements."]],[474,["You know the five elements, which have made this body of ours."]],[480,["And these five elements are on the right-hand side"]],[484,["of the human beings"]],[486,["and these five elements either push you towards the left side"]],[494,["or pull you towards the right side."]],[497,["I mean to say that when your start using the matter"]],[501,["gradually you become lethargic."]],[504,["You become slave to it, it forms a habit."]],[507,["If you use a chair then you cannot sit on the ground."]],[511,["If you are used to a comfortable life,"]],[513,["you cannot live in an uncomfortable life. Sort of it slaves you."]],[518,["Secondly, if you try to overpower the matter,"]],[524,["getting overactive with matter, you make everything properly"]],[528,["and make everything nicely and everything;"]],[531,["you are over efficient with the matter,"]],[535,["then your ego develops and when your ego develops"]],[539,["you go into violence."]],[543,["Because if you produce more, you have to be violent about it"]],[546,["otherwise you do not know how to sell it."]],[549,["You become, sort-of an aggressive businessman or a country,"]],[557,["which tries to sell the matter, which tries to overpower"]],[561,["other nations with their material advancement."]],[565,["With violence you go little further, then"]],[570,["what becomes out of you is nothing but you become materialistic."]],[574,["And materialistic people have no heart."]],[578,["A materialistic person has no heart. He is just dried out."]],[582,["He only understands money, money and money."]],[585,["He doesn’t go beyond it. So too much attachment to money"]],[589,["is also materialistic, waste of money is also materialistic;"]],[594,["mismanagement of money is the worst of all."]],[597,["So to be materialistic is your nature. You have started with it."]],[605,["That’s human nature to be materialistic"]],[607,["because we have started with matter."]],[609,["But it is also the human nature to ascend."]],[613,["As it is natural to be a beast,"]],[618,["it is more natural to be a Sahaj Yogi."]],[623,["So both things are part of the nature."]],[625,["Now which way you go is the thing."]],[627,["Now the ladder can take you up or can bring you down."]],[630,["If you have to go up your eyes should be upward."]],[633,["Now these five elements create what within you?"]],[636,["They create the five chakras within you or you can say"]],[640,["the six chakras are created out of these five elements."]],[648,["And these five elements, when they create the chakras"]],[655,["then they also give us a support to have the deities’ aasana,"]],[666,["a seat for the deities to come in. So they are important."]],[672,["But if you have to give a deity a seat,"]],[676,["you do not give some sort of a filthy seat."]],[681,["You give a nice, the best seat,"]],[685,["whatever is available, to the deity."]],[691,["So you must know that when you are using the matter,"]],[698,["see the auspiciousness of it."]],[703,["You have to know the auspiciousness of things that you are using,"]],[707,["whether it is auspicious or not. At random we buy clothes."]],[712,["At random we buy things."]],[717,["If you could use your vibratory awareness"]],[720,["to buy your things to see what you should buy, what would look nice"]],[726,["because beauty and auspiciousness goes hand in hand."]],[729,["They are not two things."]],[731,["Because beauty is a thing that gives joy to your Spirit,"]],[735,["auspiciousness is the same, which gives joy to your Spirit."]],[739,["All other beauty is no beauty."]],[743,["So for a Sahaj Yogi it is necessary to use"]],[746,["all the matters, which are auspicious."]],[752,["Now auspicious matters, whatever are there,"]],[755,["which are important matters must be kept at a higher level always."]],[761,["For example say My photograph, is very auspicious."]],[767,["Then you don’t put it on the ground, then don’t trample over it."]],[774,["In that also there are gradations of auspiciousness."]],[778,["But now your clothes because you are saints now, are very important."]],[785,["You are saints do you realize? Do you realize your self-esteem?"]],[791,["You are saints now. What clothes you wear?"]],[794,["you are not vagabonds. You are not tramps."]],[798,["You are not on the street. So you have to wear dignified dress."]],[805,["I have told everyone of you that, “Wear something dignified,"]],[808,["not indignified.”"]],[811,["It has to be majestic, because you are a saint now."]],[815,["You are no more a person running on the street,"]],[818,["you are the selected saints by God."]],[822,["So a dress you wear need not be absurd or something funny"]],[827,["but should give you dignity."]],[832,["Not any false but a real dignity. You see the vibrations of a dress."]],[836,["Wear your country’s dress."]],[839,["You need not wear somebody else’s dress or something,"]],[841,["but the interest in the dress should be that"]],[844,["it should give you dignity and a sense of respectability."]],[849,["It is to preserve your respect that you have to wear a dress."]],[855,["That is the utility of a dress."]],[857,["And now you go to another thing, anything that you are using,"]],[862,["for example your house."]],[865,["Your house should be a house of cheerfulness, a house of dignity"]],[873,["where people come in, they have comfort, they sit comfortably."]],[877,["But too much comfort is against Sahaj Yoga."]],[880,["But spartan also is not necessary"]],[883,["that you do not have anything to spread on the ground or something."]],[887,["It should be comfortable. But it should not be comfort personified,"]],[891,["because comfort creeps on you."]],[892,["Comfort is one thing is better for English people"]],[895,["to avoid completely, is very good for them not to allow the body"]],[900,["to get into comfortable positions."]],[903,["Specially bathroom addiction is"]],[905,["too much in English people I have seen it."]],[908,["It is so much so I was so surprised that"]],[910,["if I go supposing to a reception"]],[914,["I can tell you whether it is owned by an Englishman"]],[917,["or by somebody else. If it is owned by an Englishman,"]],[920,["the bathroom will be done up very well,"]],[921,["there will be towel for everything, soap for everything,"]],[925,["I mean they are extremely particular."]],[930,["And immediately I know that it is done by some English gentleman,"]],[934,["because they are very bathroom conscious."]],[940,["Though they do not take baths."]],[946,["I have seen houses with sixty bedrooms and"]],[950,["no bath in England only. Now of course they have started."]],[954,["Bathing is not their quality."]],[957,["But bathroom – they are very particular."]],[961,["And even if you put an easy chair they wouldn’t mind"]],[963,["sitting in a bathroom."]],[968,["And as far as bathroom is concerned"]],[971,["one should just form such habits,"]],[974,["that within ten minutes you should be out from the bathroom."]],[978,["Now when I say you have to take your baths,"]],[981,["that doesn’t mean that early in the morning go and take a shower,"]],[983,["it doesn’t mean that. You should take a bath at a time"]],[986,["when you’ll have one hour before going out,"]],[990,["but that also from auspicious point of view."]],[992,["Now you are saints, so use water as much as you can."]],[998,["Wash your hands ten times is very essential."]],[1001,["To get your vibrations all right, you must wash your hands."]],[1004,["But now in India there are people"]],[1006,["who wash their hands countingly sixty four times."]],[1011,["And I always warn about the another side of it,"]],[1014,["like doctors go on washing their hands. In the same way,"]],[1016,["there are some people who go on washing their hands."]],[1019,["You need not take out the skin out of your hands."]],[1022,["But as many times as you wash your hands, it is a good thing."]],[1027,["I mean you are saints but you are children."]],[1030,["And I have to talk to you as to the children who are saints."]],[1034,["It’s a big complication. While you are grown up people"]],[1039,["and sometimes you might feel hurt also, the way I have to tell you,"]],[1042,["but this is important that you have to understand that"]],[1048,["“We are saints and as saints, what we have to do as far as"]],[1052,["the matter is concerned.” Now in a house there should be no dirt."]],[1061,["Dirt is not the sign of a saintliness. Miserliness: dirt -"]],[1066,["you come to somebody’s house and you find a miserable beggary hole."]],[1073,["That kind of a thing should not be. You must have proper plates,"]],[1077,["proper things or a broken plate somewhere, no."]],[1081,["All these things should be clean, neat, maybe handmade,"]],[1086,["or even if you don’t get handmade,"]],[1088,["but they should be clean, auspicious."]],[1090,["If you can get handmade things, nothing like it."]],[1093,["That’s a very good idea if you can get hand made things and if you"]],[1097,["can use them it’s very good."]],[1100,["I think we went to see Gandhiji’s ashram, didn’t we?"]],[1103,["You saw it was a simple place but very well done, everything."]],[1107,["And that way Japanese are very good at these things;"]],[1111,["one has to learn a lot from them. You have to learn"]],[1113,["from so many people and because of Zen influence, the Japanese"]],[1118,["picked up the aesthetics of life. Very simple house they will have"]],[1122,["but everything very comfortable. And they know how to make"]],[1127,["the house look beautiful and how to make people feel comfortable."]],[1154,["Matter is to be treated with respect because it is created by God."]],[1161,["But whatever is respected is to be respected – not everything."]],[1168,["Everything in the matter is not to be respected."]],[1172,["For example, if you see some sort of a painting,"]],[1179,["which is not auspicious, is not auspicious."]],[1184,["You should refuse to see such a painting. You should avoid"]],[1186,["seeing such painting because it is not going to give you any joy,"]],[1190,["any happiness, nothing. It’s not going to work out."]],[1193,["Now one of the things which people always tell Me"]],[1195,["that in … “Sahaj Yogis do not have a presence.\""]],[1203,["This is a very important thing. The presence is done by matter."]],[1212,["Now our presence, if it is not all right people can make it out."]],[1218,["All things that are in us,"]],[1222,["if they become auspicious will have a presence."]],[1224,["Wherever we’ll stand people will know there’s a presence."]],[1230,["And this presence is a blessing of the matter to us."]],[1237,["So you must respect matter in the sense what clothes you wear."]],[1241,["Throwing clothes on the ground, throwing here and there,"]],[1244,["living like a donkey, like a pigsty,"]],[1247,["is not the way a Sahaj Yogi should live."]],[1251,["He has to be orderly; he has to respect his clothes."]],[1256,["But it should not be that you respect your clothes so much"]],[1259,["that you throw away others’ clothes.","The others are Sahaj Yogis also."]],[1262,["You have to respect each other because you are all saints."]],[1265,["If you respect yourself you have to respect others."]],[1272,["And once you start respecting the matter,"]],[1276,["which is the essence in you, that is attention."]],[1279,["The essence of matter is attention."]],[1283,["Attention gives you the presence. For example –"]],[1290,["recently Marie was with Me. While translating Me, she suddenly"]],[1295,["saw some flowers here and there, she started putting them right."]],[1299,["It created a very funny situation. Everybody started seeing"]],[1302,["what’s matter with this woman? But now she’s understood it."]],[1307,["And now I told her that, “When you are speaking you should say it"]],[1311,["with full concentration. Your attention, where is your attention?”"]],[1319,["If your attention is on money, even if I am talking"]],[1326,["about the highest things you’ll be thinking about money."]],[1329,["If your attention is on something else, even if I am talking"]],[1334,["to something, you will be thinking of something else."]],[1338,["That’s why our presence should be such that nobody’s attention"]],[1343,["is diverted or deluded. You understand My point?"]],[1349,["If your presence is funny, like a joker or a clown"]],[1352,["or a funny, untidy, everybody’s attention will be disturbed."]],[1358,["If you are overly dressed also the attention will be disturbed."]],[1363,["But if you are completely a presence then wherever you stand,"]],[1368,["people will feel there is somebody standing, great."]],[1372,["The respect flows, actually respect flows."]],[1377,["And it is something so remarkable that you don’t know how people"]],[1381,["try to help you then and how it works out."]],[1388,["Your attention if it is dominated by matter, people can make it out."]],[1395,["And that is one thing has to look after very clearly because these"]],[1400,["are countries who have advanced so much in material advancement."]],[1407,["So what happens, every matter attracts your attention."]],[1410,["You go on the street there’s this one woman is standing"]],[1415,["or there is something selling, this happening. All the time"]],[1417,["the attention … You see it is their job to attract your attention,"]],[1422,["otherwise how are they going to exploit you?"]],[1424,["See, they will have no justification. So they produce things, they"]],[1428,["advertise things, to do in such a way to distract your attention."]],[1431,["Now this is a force, which is acting against our attention."]],[1434,["So as far as possible keep your attention straight,"]],[1439,["or on the Mother Earth. If you can control your attention,"]],[1442,["you can overcome your material domination."]],[1446,["Now the best thing is to put attention to your Spirit."]],[1453,["If you start putting your attention to Spirit,"]],[1456,["the sweetness of the Spirit itself will make the whole thing"]],[1459,["very sweet and beautiful. The attention should be in the Spirit."]],[1463,["Even you are getting ready; keep the attention on the Spirit."]],[1466,["Now it’s not difficult because Kundalini has reached that stage."]],[1469,["Before realization if I had said it, then you would have said,"]],[1472,["“Mother, how to do it?” But now when you have got realization,"]],[1476,["try to bring your attention to Spirit."]],[1480,["Means first when the Kundalini rises you start looking"]],[1485,["the Spirit or you say when you get realization you see the Spirit."]],[1489,["In the sense that the Spirit starts flowing through you,"]],[1492,["you start watching its flowing in this thing."]],[1495,["But then after some time, you must enter into Spirit and see"]],[1501,["through the window of the Spirit, the whole thing"]],[1505,["by developing your witness Spirit."]],[1508,["If you develop your witness state,"]],[1513,["from attention you become knowledge, the truth."]],[1522,["Then material things become the knowledge;"]],[1528,["aesthetics of matter start giving you joy."]],[1533,["You do not want to possess it, but they start giving you joy"]],[1536,["and even if you want to possess it, it would be just to enjoy it"]],[1542,["and give it away to somebody else. It’s like that."]],[1545,["It’s for your enjoyment and you want to give it away to someone else"]],[1552,["When you develop your witness state this will come to you"]],[1555,["that you will not keep things to yourself"]],[1560,["but you would like to give and share, sharing."]],[1565,["That is the time you should know you have become a witness, because"]],[1569,["you're enjoying. Witness state is the state of Shri Krishna, of Virat."]],[1575,["When you start sharing your things then it is a proper thing."]],[1620,["Now the essence of puja is also how to overcome our material grossness."]],[1633,["Puja is nothing but is how to overcome our material grossness."]],[1643,["When we want to have a matter to ourselves,"]],[1648,["we must know that it is given to us by God."]],[1651,["Everything belongs to God. Supposing we give flower to God,"]],[1656,["after all it is God’s own creation, what are we giving?"]],[1659,["We show light to God or do ‘aarti’ to God. What?"]],[1664,["It is all God’s light only, what do we do?"]],[1669,["But by showing light to God what we do is we worship light within us."]],[1682,["The light element gets enlightened within us."]],[1690,["The light element is here on the Agnya."]],[1696,["When you do aarti, or when you put light before God,"]],[1702,["when you show light to God, the light element within you gets"]],[1708,["enlightened. When you give flowers, Mooladhara gets enlightened."]],[1716,["When you get honey, then your attention gets enlightened."]],[1724,["So, why we give it to God, after all God doesn’t need anything."]],[1728,["But God is the enjoyer. You are not the enjoyer, you cannot enjoy."]],[1733,["Enjoyer is God. In you, when God is there that enjoys,"]],[1736,["that is the Spirit."]],[1742,["So whatever pleases your Spirit is used in the puja to be given."]],[1750,["Now you give rice – all these things are discovered –"]],[1754,["that you give rice to the Devi. Rice should be put in Her lap."]],[1758,["Now what is rice, a little rice to a Devi?"]],[1763,["Is, by putting rice, in you the satisfaction of getting food"]],[1769,["or food that gives you satisfaction is enlightened."]],[1779,["But that doesn’t mean you start showering things on Me,"]],[1782,["that doesn’t mean that. What I am trying to say,"]],[1784,["do it with dignity and understanding. That you give Me rice."]],[1789,["Now, rice giving – these people don’t understand"]],[1793,["why rice is to be given to God? After all, why give Him palm leaves?"]],[1798,["What is He going to do? If Christ was the Son of God."]],[1804,["What was the use of putting palm leaves for Him?"]],[1811,["Or to give Him oil, oil bath or to rub His feet with oil?"]],[1818,["It is for you to get the advantage."]],[1821,["Now in Sahaj yoga it is proved now."]],[1823,["When you rub My feet, you feel better, not Me."]],[1827,["You rub My hands, you feel better."]],[1830,["When you fall at My feet, you feel better."]],[1833,["She, she is a great – what was, what is, what were you doing?"]],[1836,["\"Reflexology.\" Shri Mataji: Reflexology. Big name, ah? Reflexology."]],[1840,["And she is supposed to know about the feet and things like that."]],[1843,["One day she said, “Mother I want to come and massage Your feet."]],[1848,["- I know this and all - that.” So I said, “All right, come along.”"]],[1851,["So she came to rub My feet. Instead of I feeling,"]],[1855,["becoming relaxed, she was becoming relaxed."]],[1858,["The more she was rubbing she was getting relaxed."]],[1861,["So you see when you do for God, the blessings comes to you."]],[1866,["You are blessed. Whatever is the problem with you,"]],[1871,["you give to God to solve."]],[1875,["Also whatever satisfies you, you give to God."]],[1879,["The satisfaction comes to you."]],[1882,["Now, these flowers when you give it to Me, Mooladhara."]],[1887,["They give you two things, Swadishthana and Mooladhara."]],[1890,["Flowers that’s why are very important. They give Swadishthana,"]],[1894,["if the flowers are beautiful, then they give Swadishthana"]],[1897,["and if they are fragrant they cure your Mooladhara."]],[1901,["Now, I mean there is no end to flowers also."]],[1907,["But think about it, that you are doing it to improve your chakras."]],[1918,["Then other things that are used like say ghee. Ghee is used."]],[1924,["It is for Vishuddhi. Shri Krishna is very fond of ghee and butter."]],[1931,["So when you rub My feet with say butter,"]],[1934,["your Vishuddhi will improve, you know that."]],[1937,["Not Mine, I have no problem. I have only one problem that"]],[1941,["you are within Me and when you have problem I have problems."]],[1944,["Because these vibrations have to go to you."]],[1947,["So I prepare vibrations here as an antidote and they have to flow."]],[1953,["It’s a very subtle thing to understand."]],[1957,["To move from gross to Spirit, this is the thing by which you move,"]],[1963,["because first you enlighten your chakras."]],[1966,["By enlightening your chakras, your deities get happy, prasanna."]],[1973,["By making the deities happy, you keep; get a passage"]],[1978,["for the Kundalini to pass through."]],[1981,["By making the passage for the Kundalini, the Kundalini goes up"]],[1985,["and then your attention starts becoming one with the Spirit."]],[1990,["It is step by step, you move from matter to subtler matter,"]],[1995,["from subtler matter to your chakras, from chakras to deities,"]],[2000,["from deities to the Spirit. Then Spirit enjoys itself."]],[2008,["So there you do not have to do anything."]],[2011,["Just give your Spirit to Spirit."]],[2015,["That’s why these things were prescribed."]],[2017,["Now people could not see this linkage."]],[2020,["They thought that, “Why should we give anything to God?"]],[2024,["After all it is all His own.” The argument started."]],[2031,["“Why should we put lights? There is no need.” But this is an escape."]],[2036,["Where are you, at what stage? You are at a stage;"]],[2040,["you are at a stage where you have to detach yourself from matter."]],[2052,["Same with Sahaj Yoga, I find it that you must understand"]],[2056,["the complete vision of Sahaj Yoga."]],[2058,["It’s a very big thing you are doing. You are not small."]],[2064,["You are doing a very great work,"]],[2067,["because it is 'the' solution of all the humanity."]],[2071,["This is the solution of all the problems,"]],[2074,["whether political, economic or anything, whatever you call it."]],[2078,["Is not only that but the more people you have,"]],[2082,["you will be surprised, I’ll work out much better."]],[2086,["Collectively I can cure cancer if you are more, if you are"]],[2090,["clear people. But your channels are so full of problems"]],[2094,["that nothing flows through you. If you get yourself cleared out,"]],[2099,["collectively I can stop cancer spreading,"]],[2103,["because if you spread more vibrations,"]],[2106,["what happens that the left and right side in Virat becomes clearer"]],[2113,["and the attack from the left and right side which creates cancer,"]],[2116,["all these horrible diseases, will be less."]],[2119,["Because there will be less."]],[2122,["But you do not understand your responsibility what you are doing."]],[2125,["You are playing into the hands of satanics."]],[2129,["By not paying attention to your cleaning,"]],[2133,["by not paying attention to your spiritual growth,"]],[2137,["you are not helping Me at all because these vibrations do not flow out."]],[2143,["They have to flow through you. If I could manage them"]],[2146,["there was no need for Me to run after you."]],[2150,["It has to flow through you, you are the channels"]],[2153,["and if you do not keep yourself clean and humble and meek about it,"]],[2159,["it doesn’t work out. You are not helping Me at all by that."]],[2163,["So the localized problem of yours limited problems, should be"]],[2170,["given up and see to the bigger problems that you’ll be solving."]],[2175,["I can stop the happening of cancer completely"]],[2181,["if I have twenty-one thousand Sahaja Yogis."]],[2184,["Completely, Cancer will go out of … leprosy I can control."]],[2190,["Cancer already I am controlling,"]],[2193,["but it’ll go down, collectively also."]],[2196,["I mean the statistics I’ve not seen but will go down."]],[2202,["It’s a left side attack and the more you try to go to left side"]],[2206,["there will be more attacks."]],[2207,["Right side attacks are also lots of these wars."]],[2211,["All these wars and all these things take place"]],[2213,["because we are invaded from the right side."]],[2216,["All these aggressive people"]],[2217,["like Hitler and all that are aggressing us."]],[2221,["How much it is necessary for you to rise above your lower self."]],[2230,["One should understand that"]],[2231,["and not to indulge into nonsense that you are doing."]],[2235,["You have to really work hard for that."]],[2237,["Even if you have to get up early in the morning, you have to get up and do it."]],[2246,["You should understand your responsibilities, that’s the main point."]],[2250,["People are now busy only doing jobs, working here, how much money"]],[2254,["you get, how much do you go, when do you go to job and all that."]],[2257,["That’s not important for us."]],[2259,["Now that doesn’t mean you give up your jobs and be a liability on the ashram,"]],[2263,["it doesn’t mean that! It means you do your jobs, have money,"]],[2266,["money is needed for the work. I need money, you know that how much"]],[2270,["money we need for all this work."]],[2272,["You have taken such a big project of going to Europe"]],[2275,["having this little money."]],[2277,["It’s not possible. But we are doing it somehow."]],[2281,["So, we need money, you have to earn, you have to give;"]],[2284,["you have to give money. Here people are,"]],[2286,["they are not even willing to give ten pounds."]],[2288,["Such people. With them where am I going to do Sahaj Yoga?"]],[2296,["We are so attached to money in a subtler way."]],[2300,["We do not understand we have to give money and we have to do it up."]],[2305,["Not only money, money’s not the only solution;"]],[2308,["we have to be ourselves channels."]],[2310,["But then some people have money,"]],[2312,["then they are exploited in a wrong way and the money’s all wasted."]],[2318,["This is precious money, this is auspicious money,"]],[2321,["this money goes into the right hands into right places."]],[2325,["Problems are created because of that."]],[2330,["Now this money I do not need, you know that very well."]],[2334,["But for your own betterment you have to give money."]],[2337,["Ask Gavin he’ll tell you."]],[2339,["He’s a very generous man and he, he found it very good."]],[2346,["It’s not that I need a single pai from you."]],[2348,["On the contrary I am willing to spend My own money on things,"]],[2351,["you know that definitely."]],[2353,["But, you must understand this work has to be done, so you need money."]],[2358,["I need not tell you that you have to pay money."]],[2361,["I have never said this to Indians, I have never told them."]],[2363,["They have never given Me a problem you’ll be amazed."]],[2365,["How they solve their problems God alone knows."]],[2367,["They are not the people of money."]],[2368,["There’s never a quarrel about money. Nobody talks about money,"]],[2371,["nobody tells Me anything, nothing of the kind."]],[2373,["Nobody oppresses anyone or mishandles anyone"]],[2377,["or controls anyone, everybody does so well."]],[2381,["Money is not with one person. Say about two, three people handle it."]],[2384,["Everybody knows how much money they are taking."]],[2388,["This one part is important."]],[2390,["For solving this problem you give Me rice."]],[2396,["It’s called as “Oti bharne,”"]],[2397,["that you give Me rice I beg of you, actually. You put it in My sari."]],[2405,["Rice, you give Me five times, I give you seven times back."]],[2410,["That’s the symbol. You know how symbols work out."]],[2412,["Even when you say, “Mother are you the Holy Ghost?” it works out,"]],[2417,["it gives you realization."]],[2421,["If there is somebody so alert and sensitive sitting before you,"]],[2427,["you must know how to do the symbols, how to do them properly,"]],[2432,["with full maturity, understanding, in the proper way."]],[2439,["You are very anxious to do the puja, but do you understand,"]],[2442,["before the puja always there’s a quarrel going on."]],[2447,["Somebody who is a very possessed person will come, to begin with,"]],[2450,["and everybody will start fighting. Imagine!"]],[2454,["You must take your bath, “What are you doing?”"]],[2459,["In the morning don’t talk to anyone. Be in hush condition."]],[2464,["You are in for opening out to the great power,"]],[2469,["which is going to solve the problem of the world."]],[2474,["So you cleanse yourself, you wash yourself; you cleanse yourself,"]],[2481,["so that you get your chakras evolved."]],[2486,["People talked against it because they became only ritualistic,"]],[2490,["mechanical; matter became very important."]],[2493,["Then only doing these things became important."]],[2496,["But not now, you people are different. You are realized souls."]],[2503,["That doesn’t mean that you should take to sanyasa or anything."]],[2506,["You should, I’ve told you, you should live like normal people,"]],[2509,["but a very dignified people."]],[2512,["Nothing of indignity, childishness, superfluousness or joker-like,"]],[2518,["clown-like, outstandingly funny, all these dresses should not be worn."]],[2522,["You should be properly dressed in a way that you have a presence."]],[2525,["I mean this is to a children I am telling you."]],[2529,["You must have a presence of grown up Sahaja Yogis, You are all saints."]],[2532,["You know such a lot even many saints do not know."]],[2535,["You can go and ask so many of them."]],[2538,["There’s one thing they know that I am that."]],[2541,["That’s one thing you do not know. They know that."]],[2548,["This is a big difference."]],[2550,["Because I am easily available to you, you do not understand."]],[2553,["For them I am great. As I told you yesterday that how these saints"]],[2557,["have recognized and they have sent people to help Me."]],[2562,["In saintliness only, your recognition of Me is poor."]],[2567,["Because if it was not, you would not be shouting in My presence,"]],[2570,["quarrelling in My presence. You give Me headaches,"]],[2573,["you tell Me things, which you should not tell Me."]],[2576,["“He knocked at my door,” somebody tells Me."]],[2579,["He says “he came there, he did this,” another tells Me."]],[2582,["You should not talk like this to Me."]],[2590,["You are materially again bound by talking."]],[2594,["From where does the talk come from? Vishuddhi."]],[2598,["Talk comes from Vishuddhi, but it starts from, the whole vani,"]],[2602,["the whole sound starts from much below. So, to raise it higher"]],[2611,["there are stages of this sound coming in."]],[2616,["And when it becomes madhyama, is in the heart,"]],[2620,["in the heart region where it just throbs,"]],[2622,["you do not feel the throbbing. Then it comes here."]],[2628,["Here it becomes vaikhari."]],[2633,["Then it becomes pashyanti means it sees, it just sees."]],[2641,["Then it becomes Para, where it becomes just silent"]],[2647,["in the aweness of the presence."]],[2654,["We have to develop those things. But we do not understand"]],[2661,["that all these things are our attributes,"]],[2665,["which we have to enlighten and rise."]],[2668,["And make every part, every petal of our being beautiful."]],[2677,["If you start understanding these small, small things,"]],[2681,["which are very important because I am talking of very big things."]],[2688,["But even a small thing can close your eyes completely."]],[2695,["It’s a very big vision I have, very big vision."]],[2700,["And that vision can be done through you people."]],[2703,["You do not think that you are ordinary."]],[2705,["Otherwise I would never have chosen you."]],[2709,["But you have no recognition of yourself also,"]],[2712,["as you have no recognition of Me."]],[2714,["You have to recognize yourselves and respect yourself."]],[2723,["Do not respect material things, respect yourself first of all"]],[2727,["and the matter within you."]],[2729,["If you move that way I think you’ll understand better what I am saying."]],[2736,["The body of a human being is a temple of God."]],[2742,["But this temple has to be enlightened and has to be auspicious."]],[2749,["You have to clear and clean your being completely"]],[2754,["so it’s a beautiful temple for God to reside there."]],[2759,["But we deceive ourselves, you see?"]],[2762,["When I am talking, you listen to Me"]],[2765,["and you think that “Oh, Mother talked very sweetly, beautifully,”"]],[2769,["finished. But nothing goes inside."]],[2772,["Why? Because of lethargy."]],[2776,["Lethargy is a thing, which is a barrier."]],[2778,["It doesn’t allow Me to go inside you."]],[2782,["It’s a barrier."]],[2783,["It’s very sweet thing, which smiles, just you see thinking,"]],[2786,["“Oh, Mother is saying something nice, it’s very great,”"]],[2789,["it gives you happiness and all that,"]],[2791,["but it doesn’t go inside, you do not imbibe."]],[2796,["And that’s why, try to put your attention to yourself"]],[2799,["and feel your dignity and honor."]],[2801,["Feel your presence that you have to have a presence"]],[2806,["and when I tell to some people, they’ll say, “I know,"]],[2809,["Mother, I know I do that.”"]],[2812,["Then why do you do it? That means you are possessed."]],[2815,["You are a possessed person that you know this is wrong,"]],[2818,["still you are doing it. Then you are a possessed person."]],[2821,["Then is better you beat yourself with shoes."]],[2824,["But that stage should go now, I don’t like you to beat yourself with shoes,"]],[2828,["I mean are you that, that level?"]],[2831,["But the level is such still."]],[2836,["And your presence is the one that should give Prasannata,"]],[2841,["is the cheerfulness to others."]],[2844,["Others should feel cheerful in your company."]],[2850,["A presence is something, which you can understand."]],[2856,["A presence has prudence."]],[2860,["It understand how to behave in a particular thing."]],[2867,["It is not imprudent like it won’t rush to a thing."]],[2871,["It won’t jump on to a thing. If somebody is talking"]],[2874,["you just do not become absolutely dominating on that."]],[2879,["When you talk, you do not talk in a way that is dramatic"]],[2883,["or sort of theatrical; or neither you talk in a way"]],[2886,["that is lunatic-like or something like that."]],[2888,["Presence has its own balance in the center"]],[2891,["and that presence must be maintained."]],[2894,["Presence is very important and just see yourself:"]],[2898,["are you having a presence?"]],[2903,["Some people are very good Sahaj Yogis, but they have no “go,”"]],[2906,["they have no dash, at all. They receive things, they see things,"]],[2911,["they should have a dash. They have to tell people,"]],[2918,["but in a way that is congenial, that is sweet, that is beautiful,"]],[2922,["that works is the point. If it does not work, what’s the use?"]],[2929,["Now again I am going for seventeen days."]],[2932,["Really seventeen days I’ll be out."]],[2934,["I miss you all very much and I feel concerned so much,"]],[2941,["because you have to still grow quite a lot."]],[2946,["I feel that among you there is no understanding of collectivity."]],[2956,["A very irritable people; you get irritable with each other,"]],[2961,["how can you? You are all saints. You must respect each other;"]],[2967,["you must love each other,"]],[2969,["talk sweetly to each other. You are all saints!"]],[2974,["A saint meets another saint, how does he meet?"]],[2978,["Have you seen anytime, a real saint meeting another real saint?"]],[2985,["You should see. You do not look like that. The first proof is this."]],[2992,["Are you really saints or not. He has gone to India, how they met you?"]],[2999,["Yogi: Take really hold of me. Shri Mataji: See? Yogi: I couldn’t believe him …"]],[3002,["Shri Mataji: How they meet each other!"]],[3004,["They’ll hug each other and they enjoy each other’s company."]],[3007,["They laugh at jokes and understand it is such a congenial thing."]],[3013,["Nobody thinks,  “I am right.” Nobody thinks like that."]],[3016,["Once you start thinking, “I am right and that person is wrong.”"]],[3018,["“I am doing all right, he’s wrong,” finished."]],[3022,["They enjoy themselves so much just like one wave it moves, you see?"]],[3026,["They are all the time laughing, enjoying you know, loudly."]],[3032,["They help each other such a lot. It’s absolutely worth seeing that."]],[3038,["While we had only five or six people to begin with,"]],[3042,["in Nilambar, from London. One better than the other."]],[3048,["They are all fighting, quarrelling and they used to come up to beating."]],[3053,["Can you believe it? This was happening."]],[3057,["So shameful I tell you and everybody was coming and telling,"]],[3062,["“What sort of Sahaj Yogis you have got, Mother? Are they Sahaj Yogis, really?”"]],[3069,["Arguing and doing this and doing that."]],[3071,["All sorts of things were on and they would not inform Me the whole of it,"]],[3076,["but part of it would come to Me. I was so ashamed. Ask Malcolm."]],[3086,["They used to, I mean they would break each other’s heads there."]],[3091,["This was the condition. Can you believe it?"]],[3097,["While you would never find any Sahaj Yogis doing that, never, in India."]],[3102,["I have not seen anyone. Anybody who tries to be funny goes out,"]],[3107,["immediately out of circulation."]],[3109,["There’s no group-forming, nobody fights with anybody, nothing."]],[3112,["And everybody was surprised how strange these people were,"]],[3116,["one better than the other. They were very irritable, hot-tempered, fighting and all that."]],[3125,["They were so surprised that how can there be."]],[3131,["Give you an example here of Chhaya, see."]],[3133,["Despite, she’s quite shocked;"]],[3137,["but she doesn’t know how to really beat things, meet."]],[3140,["People are so criticizing, so this thing,"]],[3143,["but she’s trying to keep the balance. She’ll be always at the back."]],[3151,["She’s never in the forward, when it comes to work she’ll be the first to do it."]],[3155,["She takes up responsibilities. This is what happened last time."]],[3165,["It’s not only lethargy,"]],[3167,["it is worse than that. In lethargy, you see it is a devil’s mind,"]],[3171,["and when you come out of lethargy you just come to blows."]],[3175,["But as it is in India, I’ve not seen people coming to blows, I really tell you."]],[3179,["Very seldom you’ll find people coming to blows."]],[3183,["I mean, people never even talk loudly or in a temper, never."]],[3189,["Now normally people are very quiet type. Then Sahaj Yogis,"]],[3194,["Oh! You should see how they enjoy."]],[3197,["Oh! The girls and boys and every one, the way they enjoy."]],[3201,["Love seeing them. You must try to enjoy each other."]],[3207,["Now the worst thing that can happen to human beings is ego."]],[3212,["Worst thing, possession is better, at least you feel the pinch of it."]],[3216,["But ego you never feel the pinch."]],[3219,["It is you never feel that there is ego in you"]],[3224,["and you think you are the most correct person,"]],[3227,["you are the best person and the temper shows here in the nose."]],[3229,["I can see the “haw-haw,” nose coming up like that."]],[3236,["Such ego, such ego,"]],[3241,["and this ego Indians have also picked up from you."]],[3244,["Those who have come in contact with you, you see,"]],[3247,["as the dog when he comes in contact with human being"]],[3250,["learns many things,"]],[3251,["in the same way Indians who have come in contact"]],[3254,["with you people have picked up ego"]],[3260,["and we can see the difference."]],[3262,["But in simple villages people try to be nice, congenial, good."]],[3268,["How – by understanding auspiciousness."]],[3272,["An auspicious presence is soothing,"]],[3275,["comforting, absorbing, beautiful."]],[3283,["And this, how do you develop?"]],[3287,["You should do little aarti to My photograph is a good idea."]],[3291,["Now when you do the aarti also,"]],[3293,["somebody is shouting at the top of his voice."]],[3295,["He’s trying to lead others. Then another trying to lead others,"]],[3299,["this should not be. There should be some, homogeneous,"]],[3301,["I can make it out, there’s no rhythm."]],[3304,["Sing in the same tone, same style,"]],[3310,["try to make it one, one, concord should be there."]],[3316,["In a humble way, in joyous way that we all are singing,"]],[3319,["all our hearts are singing."]],[3321,["All of us are here to do it."]],[3323,["So many of us are… feel that joy, we are so many."]],[3328,["And it has a very bad effect on others when they see you this way."]],[3333,["I mean anybody would be shocked."]],[3337,["Why in India it is spreading, because they see that love"]],[3343,["between the people."]],[3347,["Now of our attention if you take it to the Spirit"]],[3352,["you’ll feel the collectivity."]],[3354,["Attention should be, as I told you yesterday,"]],[3357,["find out how many times you have talked nicely to others"]],[3361,["and how many times have you have been quarrelling."]],[3363,["If somebody says even a harsh word just keep quiet."]],[3367,["Do not feel bad, it’s all right, it comes and goes."]],[3371,["Now some people are negative"]],[3374,["in the sense that they are on the left hand side"]],[3377,["and some people are negative because they are on the right hand side."]],[3381,["Sometimes these combinations work very well."]],[3384,["When a dominating man tries to dominate a left handed person,"]],[3388,["they are great friends, nothing like it."]],[3391,["Because one dominates and another takes the domination."]],[3394,["As soon as the left hand side person becomes little on the center"]],[3398,["or tries to come to the right, the dominating ones starts clashing."]],[3402,["Then they are the worst enemies of each other."]],[3407,["It happens like that, so be on the alert."]],[3410,["Now a person who is on the negative on the left side,"]],[3416,["should try to come in the center"]],[3418,["and in the same way a person who is on the"]],[3422,["right side should come to the center."]],[3424,["Now how do you do it? Which is the way we can do it? Let us see it."]],[3431,["A person who is very much on the right hand side"]],[3434,["should try to become friendly with the left hand side"]],[3441,["and left hand side person"]],[3443,["should try to be friendly with the right hand side, supposing."]],[3447,["Let us start like this. So what is the give and take in this thing?"]],[3452,["The person who is on the right hand side will be better organizer,"]],[3457,["may be, may not be."]],[3461,["At least will be a better orator or maybe a better sort of a leader,"]],[3467,["may be, may not be, you can’t say."]],[3470,["He may be the one who will"]],[3474,["suggest things and who will bring out things,"]],[3477,["who will say “I’ll do this; I’ll do–” sort of thing, maybe."]],[3480,["The left hand person will be frightened"]],[3483,["but will be humble, more loving, more affectionate."]],[3489,["He’ll be much more at the command of others."]],[3493,["This one will be commanding"]],[3494,["and the other will be receiving the command."]],[3497,["This will be there. Now how do we"]],[3498,["solve the problem of this mixture, you see?"]],[3502,["The one who is very much on the ego side"]],[3507,["should try to obey the person who is on the left hand side."]],[3515,["And on the left hand side should try to command"]],[3518,["more on the right hand side person and should be accepted."]],[3522,["They, it should be mutually understood,","there should be a contract. “All right,"]],[3525,["I am an ego oriented person and you are superego oriented,"]],[3529,["now let us do one thing."]],[3530,["You try to dominate me and I’ll try to obey you.”"]],[3534,["It will work out. It’s a psychological style."]],[3536,["You just work it out."]],[3538,["Try somebody who is a left sided person to dominate you."]],[3543,["But rather difficult to get left sided people here."]],[3545,["They are very few, because I believe some people were left sided,"]],[3549,["but when it comes to ego they are worst than anybody else, you see?"]],[3553,["So rather difficult, but you can have a person who is left sided"]],[3559,["and let than ego oriented ask him to dominate."]],[3565,["Till he develops his ego, he’s all right. If he develops ego stop it."]],[3569,["But with complete understanding, watching yourself, how you develop,"]],[3573,["how far you go – a play should go on. Play with yourself."]],[3578,["But if you are identified with yourself that"]],[3580,["“I am always right, and nobody is right,”"]],[3582,["nothing can work out. I can tell you this much."]],[3584,["Because if you are perfect I need not waste My words here."]],[3590,["So the best way is to do this sort of a thing,"]],[3594,["“All right you order and I’ll do."]],[3597,["Come along let’s see what do you think?"]],[3599,["Let you organize and we’ll do it. You tell us how to do it.”"]],[3605,["So he will use your heart"]],[3607,["and you will use your attention, it will work out very well."]],[3610,["The combination will be good."]],[3612,["Let us decide to improve ourselves and not to feel bad about it."]],[3617,["We have to improve a lot and a lot and a lot,"]],[3621,["because the relationship between you seems to be so bad."]],[3624,["It’s like cancer – absolutely cancer. It is malignant."]],[3635,["So try to see your ego"]],[3638,["and if it’s a…now even people if you have told them"]],[3641,["that somebody says you should say"]],[3642,["“I’m sorry,” they’ll not say like that."]],[3644,["They’ll say sarca… “Aha, I am sorry,” or something like that."]],[3648,["They’ll say in a sarcastic way so that sorry also has no meaning."]],[3652,["All right, all right don’t say anything. This is not the way."]],[3657,["You should say, “See yourself. So this ego has come."]],[3663,["Now please tell me something else, I’ll do it.”"]],[3667,["Christ washed the feet of His disciples. Just think of that."]],[3676,["And that’s what a sensible Sahaj Yogi does."]],[3678,["He washes the feet of another disciple."]],[3681,["If you remember Aradhna, my granddaughter,"]],[3685,["when you people came to My house."]],[3687,["There were I think about eight or ten of them."]],[3690,["She got a small bucket; she washed each and everybody’s feet."]],[3695,["Every time she would take it back to the bathroom throw it away,"]],[3698,["again fill it up bring it with great Spirit. She was five years."]],[3703,["She had not completed her five years"]],[3705,["and she would wash everybody’s feet,"]],[3708,["wipe them, again put back."]],[3710,["She did for everybody and then after that she came on My feet"]],[3715,["and then she said “I’m not going to look at anybody,"]],[3717,["I’m going to run away now I have done my job,” and she went away."]],[3722,["Aradhna is of a very high quality Sahaj Yogini she is,"]],[3725,["very high quality."]],[3727,["But she thought that this is the best way of washing their feet"]],[3731,["is showing the essence of collectivity."]],[3734,["“Some part of me is not all right, let me clear it.”"]],[3741,["For example if you think of Me"]],[3744,["and you, you will understand how much I work hard on you."]],[3749,["Why? Because I love you very much and you are My part and parcel."]],[3754,["If you are not all right I’m not going to be all right."]],[3758,["If you consider then, you will never think somebody is lower than you."]],[3763,["Is better to wash the feet of someone than to wash your own feet,"]],[3767,["will be a good idea. Put down your ego every time."]],[3772,["Mohammad Sahib used this method. But best was used by Nanaka:"]],[3777,["He said, “Let all the Sikhs do some seva.”"]],[3782,["They have to, as a punishment they have to do some seva."]],[3785,["So, what is a seva when there is a group? Somebody has to sit down."]],[3790,["Even one guru, very big guru, had to clean the shoes"]],[3794,["of all the people who came for the program."]],[3797,["He was given polish, brush and everything –"]],[3800,["very recently he was punished"]],[3802,["to clean the shoes of the people who came round."]],[3805,["He was supposed to wash their clothes,"]],[3807,["wash their things, as a punishment."]],[3810,["Anybody who is arrogant should do it."]],[3812,["Anybody who quarrels or fights should do it."]],[3815,["Anybody who is blunt should do it. And it worked, it works."]],[3822,["They are supposed to wash their clothes,"]],[3824,["they are supposed to wash their feet,"]],[3826,["rub their feet, give them a massage and feel better."]],[3833,["In India if you see,"]],[3834,["all the Sahaj Yogis are working on each other’s chakras."]],[3837,["But here nobody will accept even that you have these chakras caught up."]],[3841,["Have you seen that? Everyday they are working, cleaning everybody’s,"]],[3846,["they’ll say, “Baba, clean my chakra,” they’ll say."]],[3848,["Then when they do it they say “Thank you, you’ve cleaned mine.”"]],[3851,["And then they helped them, they rub their hands, feet"]],[3854,["because you have done so much work for them. This is not done here."]],[3860,["I would like to see more mutual understanding, mutual love,"]],[3865,["mutual attraction for each other, should look forward to each other."]],[3872,["Try to help each other than to criticize."]],[3875,["I hate to hear any criticism of anyone from any one of you."]],[3880,["But when it gets, goes too much is better to tell Me."]],[3885,["But you must judge yourself, “What are we doing for others?”"]],[3888,["Some people think, “As long as we keep quiet it’s all right.”"]],[3891,["It’s not the point."]],[3893,["Try to be nice, give some presents, talk to them"]],[3897,["and there are so many ways of expression of your love to them."]],[3902,["Give sometimes flowers, try to find out what are the likes them."]],[3908,["and dislikes of the person is, is very good idea."]],[3910,["Do not do things that people do not like, sometimes you see."]],[3913,["It’s better not to do it. What is the use?"]],[3916,["If the relationships are spoilt, not to do those things."]],[3919,["Just find out what you don’t like."]],[3922,["A simple thing: my husband doesn’t like Me to put flowers in the hair."]],[3927,["But in Maharashtra all the married women"]],[3930,["are supposed to put the flowers in the hair,"]],[3933,["that’s a custom. But because of I’ve married him, he doesn’t like"]],[3938,["because in their community, only bad women put flowers in the head;"]],[3941,["I have never put flowers in My head."]],[3943,["Only when it is a special puja or they tie up –"]],[3948,["in Maharashtra, there I agree."]],[3950,["But I never make a bun and put a thing. It’s all right,"]],[3953,["if he doesn’t like it why do it?"]],[3955,["Unnecessary to increase all the clashes and the problem."]],[3961,["Don’t do anything that people do not like you to do."]],[3964,["Try to avoid, it creates problems."]],[3968,["Try to do something that pleases others."]],[3970,["Let us see if you have devised this method how to please."]],[3974,["If you please others, your deities will be very happy,"]],[3977,["because they are all one,"]],[3979,["within you, within her, within her, they are all one."]],[3983,["And they feel happy, because they’re all related to each other,"]],[3987,["and they feel unhappy when you try to be unkind to each other,"]],[3990,["because they are one."]],[3994,["If this is worked out, properly, understandingly,"]],[3998,["all of you are going to be great saints."]],[4001,["I see your image in future also."]],[4003,["Of some of you are going to be very, very great"]],[4006,["and some of you are going to take it up."]],[4009,["It’s a, it’s a project launched."]],[4012,["Launch a project against yourself,"]],[4014,["towards yourself, building up yourself."]],[4017,["How sweet you are going to be others, let’s have it."]],[4021,["Talk to others. Some people just don’t talk,"]],[4023,["I have seen they are all the time …[SILENCE];"]],[4026,["they will have very bad Vishuddhi."]],[4028,["You must talk; you must be nice you must be open-hearted."]],[4032,["This Yugoslav girl is very open–hearted,"]],[4034,["I like her for that reason. She has a big heart."]],[4037,["Talk with a big heart, open!"]],[4040,["No secretiveness and this cold, what is it called, English manner?"]],[4047,["Yogini: Aloof? Shri Mataji: Aloof?"]],[4052,["Yogini: When you keep yourself above people."]],[4056,["Shri Mataji laughs: Aloof."]],[4058,["I think there must be some English special word for this thing."]],[4062,["The way they are cold you know. When you sit….Other yogini: Stiff upper lip, Mother."]],[4066,["Shri Mataji: Ha? Several yogis: Stiff upper lip … Upper lip."]],[4070,["Shri Mataji: Upper lip? Upper lip, not so much upper lip."]],[4072,["There need not be upper lip, could be pride."]],[4075,["[Yogi’s laugh and one make an indistinct comment at which Shri Mataji laughs]"]],[4083,["Shri Mataji: That kind of a presence is here, [INDISTINCT: DOUR,]"]],[4088,["which is specialty of English also, isn’t it?"]],[4090,["You go in a train, they just don’t talk. I mean they don’t allow you to talk,"]],[4093,["they freeze you with silence."]],[4098,["They can’t see people laugh, smile or joke,"]],[4100,["anything a …[SILENCE] and you don’t know what to do with them."]],[4104,["Newspaper they will read only all the way,"]],[4107,["and they will fold it and read it."]],[4110,["But they know each and everything about you."]],[4113,["Yogini: Could it be called “insular.”"]],[4117,["Shri Mataji: Insular. Ah yes! And is a very dangerous thing for Sahaj Yogis."]],[4122,["The one who becomes insular is in for trouble."]],[4127,["Is in for trouble, insular."]],[4130,["You know why, because you are left alone, you’ll be attacked."]],[4134,["Be together. All these bhoots also know you are insular."]],[4139,["They’ll attack you."]],[4142,["By any chance you try to become unique, they’ll attack you."]],[4146,["Even some people become,"]],[4148,["by talking too much also they can become insular, unique;"]],[4151,["you sit on top of everybody else. Better be with everyone, is better."]],[4159,["Be one with everybody, congenial."]],[4161,["Take a joke from others."]],[4163,["Other are joking with you, you should not get angry."]],[4165,["If somebody joking with you, “Oh! Shut up.”"]],[4167,["Like that one should not do. Take a joke, be a sport."]],[4172,["English language has one very good quality"]],[4175,["that they can laugh at themselves, you see. All the"]],[4178,["language has found out ways and methods of how to laugh at yourself,"]],[4183,["that’s something beautiful about English language."]],[4186,["I don’t think any language has so many words"]],[4189,["to express these odd situations,"]],[4193,["which are very, very embarrassing you see."]],[4197,["You can only brand them and by branding them, you know where you are."]],[4202,["You exactly know what medicine is needed for this."]],[4205,["You see it is like that."]],[4206,["It’s just branding, “Oh this is it,”"]],[4209,["and it’s very interesting to watch these things"]],[4212,["in the society and everywhere."]],[4213,["Which is described, even Charles Dickens, now example,"]],[4216,["at that time he found out these things"]],[4218,["and he said it. And I mean the description of all these things is"]],[4222,["so beautifully done in the literature that you are amazed how people"]],[4227,["had a capacity to see themselves,"]],[4229,["the society as it is and to de… Characterization of people:"]],[4233,["how characters are built up you see"]],[4235,["and how it becomes a social problem."]],[4237,["It’s beautifully done"]],[4239,["and that’s the wisdom. That’s the real wisdom of British, I tell you"]],[4244,["I mean you may lose it"]],[4246,["if you start getting dominated by nonsensical ideas,"]],[4249,["but otherwise that wisdom you have innate."]],[4251,["I mean to have a person like Shakespeare itself shows what?"]],[4254,["I mean you are a country of great people. How can that be?"]],[4258,["Where some, they are not  “some,” there are quite a lot of them"]],[4263,["and you are going to be the wisest"]],[4265,["because you have the advantage of their creation."]],[4268,["On top of, you have got advantage of your creation."]],[4272,["Then/that? you belong to a great country like that."]],[4275,["Imagine the whole country is getting into the mire of lethargy,"]],[4280,["who is going to save this country?"]],[4281,["You people. So again and again it is against lethargy"]],[4288,["and whatever is lethargy is anti Christ,"]],[4294,["is anti God, is anti Mataji."]],[4300,["Try to become cheerful and blissful,"]],[4305,["happy, dignified, sensible, sweet."]],[4312,["It’s not too many things, is very few, it’s only one."]],[4317,["And I know we are going to enjoy life very much."]],[4321,["You are going to be very happy people."]],[4324,["Take out your tempers from your heads first of all, the angers you see"]],[4329,["and to say, “I got very angry.” Means what? Why did you get angry?"]],[4333,["To be proud of your anger and temper and your irritations!"]],[4338,["It will be very beautiful I am sure. You are growing up,"]],[4341,["but the growth becomes little"]],[4344,["dwarfed with these nonsensical things, you know."]],[4347,["So you have to protect your growth from these things"]],[4350,["as we protect a small plant from say frost falling on a plant."]],[4356,["It’s like that."]],[4357,["Frost is nothing compared to the plant, because plant is growing,"]],[4361,["but the frost can kill it and that’s how you do not make it a frost."]],[4364,["Be cheerful."]],[4366,["People come up and they go down. I’ve seen people come up"]],[4369,["and then they go down. Try to look after yourself."]],[4372,["Now after seventeen days I am going to come and see you"]],[4375,["very beautifully developed and all the time My attention is on you,"]],[4378,["I work on you all the time."]],[4380,["And I’m much more intimate with you than with anybody else,"]],[4387,["because these people see Me only for two days"]],[4390,["and then they started crying!"]],[4393,["They’re lost. But I see you so much, more than even Indians."]],[4401,["Is Paul there? Paul has come?"]],[4405,["Yogi: Yes Mother."]],[4407,["Shri Mataji: Yes. Hm. Paul, what happened?"]],[4412,["Paul: I want to get a message to, from the people of India… Shri Mataji: Ha?"]],[4417,["Paul: …Apart from the – the people of India send their love."]],[4419,["But one of the Sahaj Yogis in india has become very ill."]],[4423,["Shri Mataji: Who? Paul: Professor [INDISTINCT: Manneh] in Rahur."]],[4426,["Shri Mataji: I know. But why did you get angry with Dhumal?"]],[4430,["Paul: Dhumal? By that time I’d really, I’d"]],[4435,["had enough of seeing in India the way that"]],[4438,["there’s two classes of people in India:"]],[4439,["those who have a lot of money and those who–"]],[4442,["Shri Mataji: And what about in this country?"]],[4445,["Paul: Well it’s the same deal in this country,"]],[4447,["but the people in this country who don’t have a lot of money,"]],[4450,["at least they have bare necessities of life."]],[4451,["You know like a roof over their heads."]],[4453,["Shri Mataji: You went there to do Sahaj Yoga or to do these things?"]],[4457,["You see, what I’m saying, where was your attention?"]],[4460,["Now you knows, Dhumal has given realizations to ten thousand people."]],[4466,["And he’s your elder brother, you should respect him."]],[4471,["He has a servant, because in India the situation is different."]],[4475,["If he gives up his servant, he’ll have no food to eat."]],[4478,["It’s not that everybody use brain."]],[4481,["You see this is one thing in this country people do not realize."]],[4484,["If you use, you work much harder than his servant, do you know that?"]],[4488,["Because your brain never stops."]],[4491,["His servants works with his hand he doesn’t think!"]],[4495,["His energy goes to his hands, he rests also."]],[4499,["You see here the idea is if somebody’s working with the hand,"]],[4502,["it’s cruelty."]],[4503,["But what about this brain?"]],[4506,["The amount of brain you use all the time – now tell me,"]],[4509,["you cannot stop your thinking, all right?"]],[4511,["Now see My servant,"]],[4513,["though he works hard, he’s much more relaxed than My husband is."]],[4518,["My husband doesn’t do even lifting a, say lifting a glass."]],[4523,["All right?"]],[4525,["And what happens, that one can say that this man is a lazy fellow,"]],[4529,["he’s enjoying everything in life,"]],[4530,["he’s enjoying all the comfort while the servant is not."]],[4534,["But My servant is, in a way, is doing his handwork,"]],[4537,["because that’s all he can do; his brain is not that developed."]],[4540,["And he has much more rest than My husband has."]],[4544,["He’s much more relaxed."]],[4547,["Somebody is the hand, somebody is the feet and somebody’s the head."]],[4551,["But if you do work with your head, is the same."]],[4554,["Now if you are doing work with your head,"]],[4556,["you have to have certain amount of comfort to your body,"]],[4560,["otherwise even if you have to suffer on your body –"]],[4563,["of course I do not say that servants"]],[4565,["should be ill-treated by any chance,"]],[4567,["that should not be done – but…"]],[4571,["And nobody gives your money to anybody else like that."]],[4574,["You see he’s paid for it"]],[4575,["and he does the work with his hands so you can see it."]],[4578,["But what about the brain part, do you see the brain how it works?"]],[4584,["I wish you could have a microscope to see how the brain works,"]],[4588,["and all the chakras, “cutcutcutcut-cutcutcutcut” going on."]],[4591,["One thought itself is a dynamite"]],[4599,["and you cannot stop it, ask him."]],[4601,["Yesterday his thought going on like a machine!"]],[4604,["There’s a machine here working out."]],[4606,["So, this happens and then one should understand"]],[4609,["that when you go to any country,"]],[4611,["you are a guest there…"]],[4613,["He was very unhappy and he wrote a very sad letter to Me"]],[4617,["and that was not good. You didn’t want him to be unhappy, you w–"]],[4621,["Paul: What if I write? Shri Mataji: Ha? Dhumal?"]],[4623,["Paul: We didn’t have an argument. Shri Mataji: Ha?"]],[4625,["Paul: I didn’t have an argument. Shri Mataji: You didn’t have what?"]],[4627,["Paul: I told him what I felt. Shri Mataji: Ha?"]],[4628,["Paul: I told him what I felt, I just went, I just… you know the most,"]],[4631,["quite a lot of places in India. And–"]],[4635,["Shri Mataji: You, what did you feel?"]],[4637,["Paul: Well I felt that if somebody’s telling me how many houses they’ve got"]],[4641,["and how many houses they’re buying, when their servant doesn’t have a roof over his head,"]],[4647,["when the roof leaks and the children–"]],[4649,["Shri Mataji: Now, supposing, here people have so many houses which are lying empty, here,"]],[4653,["in England. Do they give their houses to you people?"]],[4657,["Do they? Is there any way?"]],[4660,["How many people you should give also, is there any system by which you should give?"]],[4665,["See that is not Dhumal’s problem, is the problem of the government."]],[4671,["Dhumal has houses, he has given a huge big fort to us as a present to Sahaj Yoga."]],[4678,["If he gives a house free to his servant, I think he will make him a parasite out of him."]],[4684,["Do you know in India, beggars have got big, big buildings? Do you know that fact?"]],[4689,["Some of the buildings on Marine Drive are owned by people who are professionally beggars."]],[4697,["So if you see some problem it has so many deeper roots, which you do not see."]],[4702,["But, you just write a letter of apology to him. I was hurt, very much,"]],[4707,["because he, he has done such a tremendous job."]],[4713,["He is going to give a huge big place to us for Sahaj Yoga."]],[4719,["Nobody has been able to do that so far."]],[4723,["He has given Me ten thousand people as Sahaj Yogis. And when you people say,"]],[4730,["“I felt,” what is this “I,” what is this “I”? I know you have a very sympathetic heart,"]],[4739,["but sometimes you are swayed by it. Sympathetic heart, to a point is good."]],[4746,["It should be prudent heart, it should not be unwise."]],[4749,["You must know the sense of proportion."]],[4751,["I mean that’s a system in India, which is working, but you cannot do without servants."]],[4755,["Here also. What is happening to you, without servants, you are all intelligent people,"]],[4760,["why you live in a mess, in pigsties?"]],[4763,["Because you are using your brains, you don’t know how to use your hands."]],[4766,["All these communistic ideas are of no use. People have to do some sort of a job,"]],[4772,["this job or that job. There’s nothing wrong. Some people who can do brain job,"]],[4777,["have to do brain job, those who have to do handwork has to do handwork."]],[4780,["Of course there should not be much disparity in their living, I agree,"]],[4784,["but that’s not his problem, is the problem of the whole country."]],[4789,["But I tell you even to servants I have seen, you give them something…"]],[4793,["There was a lady nurse, you see?"]],[4796,["Once I was rather sick so she used to come and see Me and help Me a little bit."]],[4801,["So I thought just as a favor I must do something to her."]],[4804,["So I sent her by our ship to sea, I said “Let her have a holiday, she’ll be all right.”"]],[4810,["So I sent her to Africa. I mean the problems are much deeper than you understand."]],[4815,["I sent her to Africa. You know, she came back and she started telling the doctor off."]],[4820,["She thought she has become the doctor."]],[4822,["And the doctor told Me, “Why did you do it?” They get into imbalances. You see,"]],[4826,["even to poor persons, if you give them something like that, they go into imbalances."]],[4833,["I’ll give you another very concrete example."]],[4836,["My husband, who is very socialistic in his approach, and is a good thing,"]],[4841,["so what he did, was to increase the pay of the drivers."]],[4844,["You see the drivers started getting one thousand Rupee, which was very, very big amount."]],[4848,["And the lowest clerk gets about say twelve hundred."]],[4851,["So there was a very little disparity."]],[4854,["Now the driver’s getting one thousand Rupees, was too much."]],[4858,["Within six months their wives came to Me."]],[4860,["They said, “This was a very wrong thing he did to our husbands."]],[4864,["They have got keeps now; they have started drinking;"]],[4867,["they have started not giving any money to us.”"]],[4871,["So to poor people if you give them more money,"]],[4874,["they do not know how to use it, they will be drinking."]],[4878,["Poor people drink much more than the rich people."]],[4881,["So they had to be trained how to use money. You just give them money is no use."]],[4889,["You do not understand the deeper… thing… People are to be brought up properly."]],[4896,["Like we have got in India Schedule Caste – I agree Schedule Caste is a nonsense,"]],[4900,["it should not be there, you should not treat somebody as a lower caste, is all right."]],[4904,["But what they have brought into now, suddenly,"]],[4907,["that Schedule Caste must have equal seats, equal rights in every job and everything,"]],[4913,["whether they are qualified or not. So you have got people who are not qualified,"]],[4916,["or even in exams, in the colleges, you must have so many Schedule Caste."]],[4922,["Now what has happened, by doing this kind of a top-heavy work,"]],[4926,["some muck has come up, and they are absolutely useless people,"]],[4931,["they cannot do administration. Instead of that,"]],[4934,["what Ghandiji had said, that, “Train them up, educate them, bring them up.”"]],[4939,["Suddenly the educated people are there"]],[4942,["and some people suddenly, uneducated, nothing, brought to that, they cannot bear it."]],[4950,["Now we had a servant with us who came to Me,"]],[4954,["who was a – you must be knowing him, Paramshivam – who came down here."]],[4957,["And he used to, he was getting hardly hundred Rupees there,"]],[4962,["we gave him a big pay and everything, when he came here he started misbehaving."]],[4968,["Then his mother, when I wrote to them that, “He’s misbehaving,"]],[4972,["I don’t know what to do. He has developed all bad habits.”"]],[4974,["He was buying pornography pictures here, going to the pub,"]],[4979,["then having girlfriends and doing all sorts of things, he started here."]],[4983,["So when I wrote to his mother, what his mother wrote to Me is very interesting to read."]],[4987,["She said, “Those people who live in mud, if they have to sleep on a bed, it hurts them."]],[4999,["So suddenly giving them something materially is not going to improve him."]],[5005,["You have to train them up. You do not know what problems there are of poverty."]],[5011,["Poverty is just like leprosy. Leprosy: you know what the leprosy parasites eat?"]],[5021,["They eat petrol; they thrive on petrol. So gross it is."]],[5033,["And then, you being an Englishman should not have said it,"]],[5037,["because English are responsible for the poverty of India, you like it or not."]],[5044,["They have created this problem for us, we didn’t have this problem before."]],[5049,["Our servants were part and parcel of our house."]],[5051,["They treated us just like slaves, so we have got this idea from them."]],[5056,["How they treated us! I must say Dhumal was very decent not to say this to you,"]],[5063,["but this is what it is. The way they treated us in India, you have no idea."]],[5068,["Even till yesterday we had “White Clubs” where Indians were not allowed on our own soil!"]],[5077,["When we were independent, and they’re fighting for it."]],[5081,["They killed thousands of people, raped so many woman there."]],[5086,["“We English” should not say that, in that country were we have ruled"]],[5091,["and made them slaves. You see they did not allow us to come up."]],[5095,["What are you doing to foreigners here who are coming up?"]],[5098,["How you treat them? What racialism you have here compared to what we have in India,"]],[5105,["we have no racialism. They treated you with such great respect."]],[5108,["They should have said, “You are white, so ‘racialism,’ all right we’ll ill-treat you.”"]],[5112,["But if you go to Africa they will teach you. Africans, West Indies – they are on top of you."]],[5120,["What I’m saying, to break the vicious circle try to understand the problem of every country."]],[5125,["From where does this problem come to India,"]],[5128,["and to most of the countries who are underdeveloped."]],[5131,["The French, they dominated also many countries."]],[5141,["This is also, one should understand that we should not dominate any more."]],[5147,["We should wash their feet, that’s what it is."]],[5155,["Now you have killed the culture of all the Africans"]],[5159,["and Africans have taken to all French and English culture."]],[5162,["Absolutely, they have prostitutes the same way you have,"]],[5165,["they have the women the same way you have; their ideas of liberation’s the same,"]],[5169,["only the Indians have resisted you."]],[5173,["Otherwise everywhere you have never respected anybody’s culture or anything."]],[5177,["You have to face it. If you go to South America,"]],[5186,["you’ll be shocked the way people have wiped out all the… all the people who lived there;"]],[5191,["all of them, one and all. Except for Columbia, can you imagine?"]],[5196,["Every country, every soul has been wiped out. Just see that."]],[5208,["Of course if he was ill-treating him I can understand, but he doesn’t ill-treat."]],[5216,["These ideas are Western ideas; they’re applicable to you people, not to Indians."]],[5222,["And this is the big mistake people are doing is to put your ideas onto us."]],[5225,["For example in field reforms, you see?"]],[5229,["My son-in-law is a very enlightened fellow, he had twenty-five miles,"]],[5233,["square miles of area of his own. But he used to get his labor from all these areas,"]],[5239,["he used to provide them everything, he used to pay them very well;"]],[5243,["they were living very well. Suddenly the idea came,"]],[5245,["“No. They must have their own land holdings,” all right – without understanding"]],[5250,["that they are to be trained, they are to be brought up, they are not educated,"]],[5253,["there must be communication – so everybody was given a one patch here"]],[5257,["and a one patch there and a one patch there and a one patch there."]],[5260,["What happened, that they started getting strangulated in those areas."]],[5265,["There was no way of communication to them, they could not get their wheat,"]],[5269,["they could not get their seeds, they could not do anything, they started starving."]],[5273,["And they came to My son-in-law that, “You come forward,"]],[5277,["you are the one who was the agency in between and you should have done it.”"]],[5281,["But they removed the agency and without training these people."]],[5285,["Ghandiji suggested these things. He said that,"]],[5288,["“You must enlighten the rich people and you must also try to emancipate these people"]],[5295,["by education, by making them understanding,” and all that."]],[5298,["There is a huge, areas in India, which are called as “Backward Areas,”"]],[5308,["where these aboriginals live. They do not believe in any sedentary habits,"]],[5313,["they are like, what you call the gypsies. So what they do,"]],[5318,["these people plough their fields and all that, and they come in the night and plunder it."]],[5324,["And they live like that. And they have been living like this and they feel very happy about it."]],[5330,["They second is this (?), the so-called poor of India."]],[5335,["You must see how leprosy grows also."]],[5338,["They started in Maharashtra a scheme by which they said,"]],[5341,["“We will provide you jobs and otherwise we’ll give you a dole.”"]],[5347,["Now this is the worst thing that can happen to anyone; that we have realized very soon,"]],[5351,["I hope they have withdrawn it. So they what they did –"]],[5354,["Indians as it is they are very cunning and clever –"]],[5356,["so what they did they would go and write their names as the people who are doles,"]],[5360,["getting doles, you see? And they would work somewhere and get the dole as well,"]],[5364,["double money. Then they would go and drink. What are these people doing,"]],[5373,["but to drink? It’s such a problem, prohibition; they, they drink iodine, they drink,"]],[5382,["what you call this… What do you eat, drink for this thing,"]],[5385,["it’s some sort of sulphuric acid or some sort of an acid they drink?"]],[5388,["I don’t know? Various yogis: Meths… Methylated Spirits."]],[5392,["Shri Mataji: Methylated or whatever… [laughs] I don’t know! I don’t understand."]],[5398,["So, you see they are so foolish,"]],[5400,["what I am saying that taking up anything like that at random is not good."]],[5406,["And I was sorry because his wife wrote to Me,"]],[5408,["“How much they have done for Sahaj Yoga.”"]],[5411,["The only solution is Sahaj Yoga. There’s no other solution, which he has helped Me a lot."]],[5418,["“You see,” and he was very sorry he said that, “How am I to do without servants?”"]],[5423,["You see the servant system is like that. If he gives roof to everyone he’ll be left with no house."]],[5428,["There’s not done, this kind of generosity’s not done anywhere."]],[5432,["If there was such an agency like that, which was doing such a work, it is possible."]],[5438,["Even the so called communists everywhere, wherever they are in a democracy,"]],[5442,["have their own properties. Once the democracy will go away they won’t be able to even talk."]],[5451,["But I do not say that Capitalism is the solution; I say Sahaj Yoga is the solution, all right?"]],[5457,["It is the Sahaj Yoga and he’s done so much for Sahaj Yoga."]],[5461,["For that servant we cannot in any way insult him; servant is not important for us,"]],[5465,["who is the servant? Who are these poor people to us?"]],[5471,["We are not responsible for them, the state is responsible."]],[5477,["We are responsible for Sahaj Yogis, because they are the people who make the difference."]]]);
